      <trans-unit id="bookmarks.description" resname="bookmarks.description" approved="yes">
        <source>You can create bookmarks to modules in TYPO3 quite easily. The treat is that you can jump between screens in TYPO3 in &lt;em&gt;one&lt;/em&gt; click rather than multiple clicks through backend modules etc. The frame also contains a field for entering a page or record id to edit or just search records.</source>
